   "tags": "single | Marks +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>A basic slide wire Potentiometer has a working battery voltage of 3 V with negligible internal&nbsp;resistance. The resistance of the slide wire is 400 &Omega; and its length is 200 cm. A 200 cm scale is&nbsp;placed along the slide wire. The slide wire has 1 mm scale divisions and it is possible to read up&nbsp;to 1/5 of a division. The instrument is standardized with 1.018 V standard cell with sliding&nbsp;contact at the 101.8 cm mark on scale. The working current and resistance of series rheostat are respectively</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>5 mA, 200 &Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>6 mA, 100 &Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>4 mA, 250 &Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>6.8 mA, 103 &Omega;</p>"
